{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-04_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-04","title":"等價交換","storyCode":"11-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cc9922de7d8b5c6f3380931873a4881ee0e79ce6e54f1ade5368ef1a7048b658","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為換取商人的貨運支持，阿勒黛被迫答應賣掉祖傳蒸汽甲胄。費斯特與博士一同來到軍工廠。阿米婭率隊牽制薩卡茲王庭軍，掩護各方行動。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"1098年\n2:55 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈爾丁女士，您總算回來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我趕上了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。這部您排了一年多的戲，孩子們可是第一回完整演出。您要是沒趕回來的話，誰會自說自話開始？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可要找個好位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們，都準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的男聲&天真的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都準備好啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關燈——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早安，閣下！您的臉上佈滿愁容，請問是什麼讓您如此心焦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"勝利的號角聲已在城牆上盤旋了三天三夜，可我的心為何還是如此焦灼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們偉大的將軍不是早已凱旋了嗎？讚美他的英勇與無畏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"英勇？無畏？也許是的。但你沒有看見他歸來時眼中的光！當他看向王冠的時候，就像荒野上盤旋的羽鷲盯著一瘸一拐的肉獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貪婪會使一個好人墮入地獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"而人們永遠只會覺得，這是自己應得的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我們的條件，阿勒黛小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"您需要把某些“貨物”運進倫蒂尼姆，而這次不同往常，無論是數量還是重量......可都不一般。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會問您運的是什麼，為什麼需要，但您必須清楚我們這樣做會冒多大風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"您也知道，眼下能幫您做這種事的人可實在不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲緊緊盯著所有物流出入口。要是讓他們知道這種私底下的交易，我們一個都沒法活著離開倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您背景再硬，盯著您的那幾位朋友再貪心，能讓您在中央區保持這樣的生活，恐怕這件事也不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"想要做成這筆生意的話，您得拿出一些匹配風險的報酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您願意見我，珀蒂先生，我會好好考慮您的提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"時間不等人。您務必儘快做出決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要價很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們討論過這種情形。眼下皇家鑄幣廠也在薩卡茲手裡，這條消息肯定早就透過瑪格納區的銀行家們傳遍了所有國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做走私生意的商人最擔心拿到的錢在下個月就變成一堆廢紙，自然需要一些長期上更能保值的酬勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想答應下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀蒂先生剛剛說得沒錯，“時間不等人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們最多還有五天準備時間。想要突襲城防軍指揮塔的話，我們必須把更多武器運進城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可他們想要的東西對你的意義非比尋常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們在這個位置上，克洛維希婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在這個位置上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼猜想它對我的意義的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我可以肯定地說，克洛維希婭，你的所有猜測都不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我是什麼了不起的坎伯蘭公爵大人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時你恐怕還沒出生，而我，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親眼目睹了維多利亞那位了不起的獅王陛下被吊死在王宮花園裡的絞刑架上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我姓坎伯蘭，坎伯蘭是陛下最忠誠的朋友，人盡皆知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在正完好無損地站在你的面前，是曾經高坐在議會裡的那些大人物發了慈悲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算如今，萊托中校的酒會我仍會頻頻參與，我對他們而言暫時還算有用，他們需要我來安撫民眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這是為了我們的事業。可這也是我的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚你的付出，阿勒黛。沒有你的掩護，自救軍不可能撐到這一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已經不是個孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣樓上的那堆東西，什麼也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一堆廢鐵而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g2_dukegarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你安排一下，把它搬下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不贊同我的決定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不敢說，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛小姐，不管您怎麼說，它......它依然是坎伯蘭家的蒸汽甲胄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的先祖——那位高貴的老公爵的鮮血流淌在甲胄裡。它是維多利亞賜予坎伯蘭家的榮耀，是坎伯蘭家“永遠高潔”的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它可以毀於戰火，可以被交付給另一位高潔之人，卻不該......不該被一個利慾薰心的商人當作貨品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得珀蒂先生不配擁有它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把古老的甲胄！當作收藏品！然後以低廉的代價換取一些——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾爾希，你一直陪在我的身邊，從我出生開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起把已經不存在的“坎伯蘭家”維持到了今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎伯蘭家不是由一堆空泛的名詞構成。“榮耀”“忠誠”“純淨”或者“善良”？事到如今，早就失去了意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾爾希，它由你，由我組成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天......他們有來信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，艾爾希，過去的音樂......彷彿還留在我的腦子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座宅邸曾經接待過一位國王。而他現在又在哪裡呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，亞歷山德莉娜殿下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......叫我維娜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了，維娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛和戰士們一起巡邏回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你仍然願意和自救軍的戰士們一起執行任務，這很了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想盡可能多做點事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰士們知道你在這裡就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽克洛維希婭說起了一些事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，只是閣樓堆了太多雜物，我總得打起精神來打掃一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那地方積了太多灰，我可不敢勞煩一位尊貴的殿下幫我的忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想看見你不得不賣掉那具甲胄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是殿下的命令嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有資格命令你，你才是自救軍在這裡的負責人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比我更清楚什麼是對自救軍而言更好的決策，我也明白甲胄能換來機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......請給我一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會想辦法解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......維娜，你可以不用管這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是自救軍奧克特里格區負責人的命令嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一切都沒有發生，說不定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，一切都已經發生了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，有戈爾丁的消息了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，她剛透過書店的發報機發了一則訊息過來，已經轉錄到您的終端上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"訊息裡說，她很安全。奧克特里格區的計劃在照常推進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你給她回信，博士小隊在剛才順利通過哨所潛入海布里區。多虧了那幾位與羅德島合作的雇傭兵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱瑟琳，九號卸貨區的傳送帶出了點問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一顆螺絲鬆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是你值班。時間越來越緊，你是怎麼工作的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是今天的進度被耽擱了，小心薩卡茲把你的腦袋當成釘子敲進鋼料裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，凱瑟琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......扳手呢？拿過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這時候倒是變機靈了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱瑟琳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下工之後去你的組長那裡做檢討。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓閒雜人員進入了工廠最重要的卸貨區。沒把你趕走都算輕的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奶奶，這和帕特沒關係，不是他放我進來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。帕特，叫上湯米和戴一起滾去檢討，你們誰都別想跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，還有你旁邊這個不知打哪來的怪傢伙......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"在叫我嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，王宮為何如此安靜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王宮？王宮在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"您明明正靠著王宮的外牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請挪一挪吧，鐵疙瘩，你擋住我的太陽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是靠著一棟無人的空房而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我是蒸汽騎士，我會肅清邪穢與不義！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人，一切已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不會結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們仍在思考什麼是善惡，只要我們依然不憚於做出選擇，就不會結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我正是為此而來，我會邀請人們加入我的隊伍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"就連您也仍然沒有鬆開握緊的拳頭，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我們被發現了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少敵人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"偵察幹員彙報說，至少有四支雇傭兵巡邏隊正在朝我們的方向過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要接近城防軍指揮塔的話，我們必須通過前面這個街區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們才剛剛踏入街區的邊緣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲守軍的反應極其迅速。也就是說，我們被伏擊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"備用路線的情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"要是雇傭兵都被引到正面來的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不，行不通！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一支隊伍在迅速靠近我們！是自救軍的兄弟剛剛發現的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"他們從薩迪恩區撤退時，跟這支隊伍打過照面！這些薩卡茲的作戰方式很......很......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"“不成人形”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是血魔的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知所有小隊成員，本次行動終止，準備撤退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了。血魔士兵的行動速度簡直不像人......自救軍戰士跟他們交火了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更改目標，支援自救軍戰士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個卡特斯在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼卡特斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跟我裝傻。她這幾天都跟你們在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽不懂你在說什麼，更不會回答你。就算你殺了我也沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是一群硬骨頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——！這都什麼啊......蟲子？！該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友，堅持住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"重整隊形，別被那些滿地亂跑的蟲子衝散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重裝幹員，掩護我們的自救軍朋友撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島與自救軍是一起來的，也會一起走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
